s with 3 level difficulties and 4 special levels.\n\nITEMS\nTake advantage of 30+ items in your tool to make your idea into a Virtual Reality solution and build your ideal Bridge!\n\nAre you ready to earn your \"BRIDGINEER\" Title?", "short_description": "Tackle Bridge Engineering problems like never before!\n\nYou are an Engineer tasked with building Bridges for different types of vehicles from an SUV to a large Truck!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.projectartiliris.com/bridge-engineer/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Project Artiliris", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.projectartiliris.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["STRATEGY", "CASUAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "545173167450277"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "840305670516274"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "840305670516274"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1671224040, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "840305670516274"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6238424436182133", "version": "1.0.0.0"}, "id": "593280731781731", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only